{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-topbright-care-pets-dr-dog-sold-via-amazon-2603-0018","content_id":"e0d7f28f-f269-4e54-b070-a8bb1e7e1685","description":"Product Safety Report for TopBright Care Pets Dr Dog presenting a serious risk of choking.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"1c6c60ff-5e65-4efe-b31d-860fe1cb21bb","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-04-22T10:28:08+01:00","id":"1c6c60ff-5e65-4efe-b31d-860fe1cb21bb","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-04-22T10:28:08+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e894a8d36883a64473b805/2603-0018-product-safety-report-care-pets-dr-dog.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: TopBright Care Pets Dr Dog sold via Amazon</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of choking as the dog’s eyes easily detach or break off during reasonably foreseeable use, creating small parts that fit entirely within a small parts cylinder.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed.</p>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Amazon).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys - Dolls/Soft Toys (Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>TopBright</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>121170</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>011122507001</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Amazon ASIN</td>\n      <td>B0DYTXDTRB</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Amazon Product Identifiers</td>\n      <td>FBA15L3122FWU000046, ST, 1211702024ig0001, X002BQO3D9</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>A battery powered plush toy with additional accessories for play.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_1c6c60ff-5e65-4efe-b31d-860fe1cb21bb\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e894a8d36883a64473b805/2603-0018-product-safety-report-care-pets-dr-dog.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of choking as the dog’s eyes easily detach or break off during reasonably foreseeable use, creating small parts that fit entirely within a small parts cylinder. These small parts pose a choking risk to young children, particularly those under 36 months of age who have a natural tendency to explore objects by placing them in their mouths.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed.</p>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Amazon).</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2603-0018</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-12T09:52:27Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["destruction-of-the-product","import-rejected-at-border","removal-of-listing-by-online-marketplace"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-03-11","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-03-12T09:52:27+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-topbright-care-pets-dr-dog-sold-via-amazon-2603-0018","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-topbright-care-pets-dr-dog-sold-via-amazon-2603-0018","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-topbright-care-pets-dr-dog-sold-via-amazon-2603-0018","content_id":"e0d7f28f-f269-4e54-b070-a8bb1e7e1685","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-03-12T09:52:27Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Safety Report: TopBright Care Pets Dr Dog sold via Amazon (2603-0018)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-topbright-care-pets-dr-dog-sold-via-amazon-2603-0018","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Serious","value":"serious"},{"label":"High","value":"high"},{"label":"Medium","value":"medium"},{"label":"Low","value":"low"},{"label":"Not provided","value":"not-provided"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,